Play it with Asciiverse
=======================

With av, the Asciiverse client (https://asciiverse.sh):

    av install netgame
    av play netgame

The original README follows.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Compile with: g++ -o netgame main.cpp
Should work on most ANSI terminals if their fonts have standard box drawing characters.
Compiles and runs under Cygwin; if you're using "Cygwin Bash Shell" then change the font to Consolas or Lucidia Console as the default font displays the terminals and the T junctions the same, making the game rather harder.
